summary:
  Space, M and typing reach nothing after the face comes back to the popup.

history:
  Plasma hands the keyboard to the item it was given as the full
  representation, which is the seat. A face that arrives under a seat that
  already has the keyboard has to be given it there and then.

target:
  package/contents/ui/PopupFace.qml

find:
          if (activeFocus) face.forceActiveFocus();

replace:
          if (activeFocus) seatItem.forceActiveFocus();

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_popupface.qml::test_a_face_seated_under_a_seat_that_has_the_keyboard_gets_it_at_once.
